28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/ubuntu.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons contributors<\/a> \/ <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/ubuntu.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on Ubuntu: apt-get, Bug Persistent - disk will be checked, Fixes, Issues, Management, and Profile, and related topics.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on Ubuntu: apt-get, Bug Persistent - disk will be checked, Fixes, Issues, Management, and Profile, and related topics.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>apt-get<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInstall packages with apt-get install and refresh indexes with apt-get update.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Bug Persistent - disk will be checked<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tClear the Ubuntu fsck-at-reboot notifier that keeps showing a disk-will-be-checked message.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Fixes<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRebuild corrupted apt lists and change software sources when update still fails.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Issues<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRemove the persistent disk check message by deleting fsck-at-reboot.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Management<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShut down with poweroff or shutdown now, and restart with reboot.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Profile<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPrepend a directory to PATH in ~\/.bashrc.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Service<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSysV init scripts under \/etc\/init.d and update-rc.d defaults.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Update<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tapt-get update, upgrade, dist-upgrade, do-release-upgrade, and rebuilding apt lists.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Version<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPrint Ubuntu release information with lsb_release -a.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/apt_get' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/apt_get' data-title='apt-get'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/apt_get\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>apt-get<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/bug_persistent_disk_will_be_checked' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/bug_persistent_disk_will_be_checked' data-title='Bug Persistent - disk will be checked'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/bug_persistent_disk_will_be_checked\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Bug Persistent - disk will be checked<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/fixes' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/fixes' data-title='Fixes'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/fixes\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Fixes<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/issues' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/issues' data-title='Issues'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/nix\/ubuntu\/issues\"><div class='ite